{"parse": {"title": "AFH-06", "pageid": 105744, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/AFH-05\" title=\"AFH-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">AFH-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/AFH-07\" title=\"AFH-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">AFH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.8C.AB.E9.BC.A0.E6.B8.B8.E6.88.8F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"猫鼠游戏\">猫鼠游戏</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 猫鼠游戏</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Cats and Rats</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>次<span class=\"color-value\"></span>蓄<span class=\"color-value\"></span>谋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>已<span class=\"color-value\"></span>久<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>追<span class=\"color-value\"></span>逐<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 192406</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-chezhannei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"chezhannei\"><img alt=\"chezhannei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-chezhannei.png/600px-Cg-chezhannei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-chezhannei.png/900px-Cg-chezhannei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Cg-chezhannei.png/1200px-Cg-chezhannei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅰ：</div><div>给我盯好每个出口！待会火车到站了，谁也不能放一只老鼠过去！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">众警员：</div><div>好的，先生！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅰ：</div><div>我会亲自上车搜捕，这只老鼠已经无路可走了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他摸了摸腰间的配枪，朝着搭档点了点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅰ：</div><div>上好子弹，他可不是两手空空来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅱ：</div><div>我知道。你也别忘了，我们可不要死人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅱ：</div><div>如果他死了，我们的钱……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他环顾四周，压低了声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅱ：</div><div>万一他没有带在身上，我们就白忙活，你明白吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅰ：</div><div>当然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们牵引着两只警犬，盯着停下来的火车。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>猫要捉老鼠了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>耳边的喧嚣声越来越大，意识逐渐清晰——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-307111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-307111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-307111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>唔……哇！大早上的，怎么这么吵……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她揉揉眼睛，从货箱中醒来，看见贾纳丹正躲在车窗后面，侧向窥视着外面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>……这个车站不对劲，站台上太安静了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>不知道哪个混蛋泄露的消息……现在警察大概已经把车站围起来了，说不定他们现在已经上车了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他蹲下来，与坎吉拉对视。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>接下来我会跳车，逃进林子里，你要靠自己到达目的地了，明白吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-565901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>我猜他们还不知道你的情况，如果他们问起你，你必须装作不认识我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>邻近车厢的喧嚣突然消失，一阵令人窒息的寂静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生：</div><div>那个低贱的小扒手就是在这里宣称看到了我的钱包……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生：</div><div>是的，陪同她的还有一个又邋遢又臭熏熏的流浪汉，拎着一个包。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>说话的声音越来越近，两人同时屏住了呼吸……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_huatian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_huatian\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_huatian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_0_bg_huatian.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_huatian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_0_bg_huatian.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_huatian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_0_bg_huatian.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_huatian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"614601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-614601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-614601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"614601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-614601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-614601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-614601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-614601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"133\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">教师：</div><div>我的孩子从不说谎，警官，他们除了闹腾一些，都是有教养的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅰ：</div><div>谢谢合作，女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅰ：</div><div>阿奇，闻闻这个钱包……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他把学生被窃的钱包递给警犬嗅了嗅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-611801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-611801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-611801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警犬：</div><div>汪——汪！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>湿漉漉的鼻子缩了缩，警犬带领着警察，往他们的方向走去——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>他*的，心喂了野狗的小兔崽子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307111.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-307111.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307111.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307111.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-307111.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307111.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-307111.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307111.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>抱歉……这都是因我而起的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>少说这些废话，现在我们被绑在一条绳上了，如果我逃走，而你被抓去审问的话……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307113.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-307113.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307113.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307113.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-307113.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307113.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-307113.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307113.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>那又怎么样！我比你想的可机灵多了。而且就算我被抓到，也不会吐出半点消息给他们的……他们能拿我怎么样？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>他们什么都干得出来，小不点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>况且，你知道你在包庇一个杀人犯吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她仰起头，盯着他的眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>不……你不是，我没有从你眼睛里看见一些……一些东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>那天晚上，我看见了你用布包好了一份钱，偷偷塞进了那个女孩的薄荷糖盒子里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他瞪大眼睛，愣住了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>我又不是睡得像一头死猪！你的脚步声那么大，早就露馅啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他撇过头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>别以为你了解我，小不点……我没有兴趣向你证明自己。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生：</div><div>奇怪，那只小狗怎么越走越远了……要我说，他们肯定躲在附近才对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生：</div><div>警官们一路上说着什么包，还有什么贿赂……都是一些难懂的话，就像最重要的不是找到那两个家伙似的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生：</div><div>还是得看我亲自找到这两个脏家伙，他们一定就躲在这些垃圾附近……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>门被轻轻地推开了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-565910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-565910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-565910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>！？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_huatian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_huatian\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_huatian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_0_bg_huatian.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_huatian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_0_bg_huatian.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_huatian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_0_bg_huatian.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_huatian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>警犬当然带对了路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-519301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-519301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-519301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">扒手：</div><div>警官，饶了我吧，我把钱都还给那位孩子好吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅰ：</div><div>……不，不是这个！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>警棍重重地捅在他肚子上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-519301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-519301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-519301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">扒手：</div><div>呕……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅰ：</div><div>你最后一次见到他们，是在哪里？你看见他们往哪里去了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅰ：</div><div>那个男人有没有带着一个包？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>血从鼻腔潺潺流出，和鼻涕、眼泪融在一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-519301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-519301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6a/HeadIconSmall-519301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">扒手：</div><div>他们、他们往那儿去了……其他的我不知道，其他的我不知道，求求你，别再打我了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>跪倒在地的窃贼，颤抖着，用手指指出了货箱的方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>警察抬起头，缓缓走向了货箱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但火车外，忽然响起了此起彼伏的犬吠——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个拳头拍打着车窗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅱ：</div><div>出来，伙计！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅱ：</div><div>贾纳丹那个混账，带着两个人质跳车了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-519101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警员Ⅱ：</div><div>该死，他窜进丛林里了！快去让车站的伙计们都集合起来！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_bg_hean\"><img alt=\"2_2_bg_hean\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png/600px-Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png/900px-Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_bg_hean.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>哈、哈……给我他*的走快点！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他用力一踹，哭哭啼啼的学生翻倒在地，洁白的校服沾满了黏糊糊的泥巴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"565810.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565810.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-565810.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"565810.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565810.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-565810.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/02/HeadIconSmall-565810.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-565810.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">学生：</div><div>呜呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">坎吉拉：</div><div>别揍他了，贾纳丹……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>滚开！你知道他把咱们都害惨了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他甩开坎吉拉的手，用刀子指向了她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>我要是再听你的一句话，帮你一个忙，我就是不折不扣的蠢驴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">贾纳丹：</div><div>——直到我们安全为止！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>树林越来越密了。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "AFH-06"}}